---
title: Crops - Vintage Story Wiki
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: "{{ lang }}/crops/index.html"
---
{% import "macros/datatable.njk" as dt %}
<h1>Crops</h1>
<p class="muted">
  Where wild crops/flowers/mushrooms/etc. and trees naturally occur, read directly from the game's
  worldgen rules.
</p>
<p class="muted">
  Climate ranges below are the raw worldgen rule the game checks, not a guarantee -- these are the
  conditions a <em>chunk</em> must meet, not a promise any single spot within it generates
  something.
</p>

<h2>Crops / flowers / mushrooms / etc. ({{ generated.blockPatches.length }})</h2>
{% call dt.datatable(40, "Search spawn patches...", ["Blocks", "Category", "Temp (°C)", "Rain", "Mod"]) %}
{% for patch in generated.blockPatches | sort(false, false, "category") %}
  <tr data-search="{{ patch.blockCodes | join(' ') }}" data-category="{{ patch.category }}" data-mod="{{ patch.sourceMod }}">
    <td>{% for c in patch.blockCodes %}<a href="{{ ('/' ~ lang ~ '/') | url }}items/{{ patch.domain }}/{{ c | slugify }}/">{{ c }}</a>{% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %}</td>
    <td><span class="tag">{{ patch.category }}</span></td>
    <td>{% if patch.minTemp != null or patch.maxTemp != null %}{{ patch.minTemp if patch.minTemp != null else "any" }}&ndash;{{ patch.maxTemp if patch.maxTemp != null else "any" }}{% endif %}</td>
    <td>{% if patch.minRain != null or patch.maxRain != null %}{{ patch.minRain if patch.minRain != null else 0 }}&ndash;{{ patch.maxRain if patch.maxRain != null else 1 }}{% endif %}</td>
    <td><span class="tag">{{ patch.sourceMod }}</span></td>
  </tr>
{% endfor %}
{% endcall %}

<h2>Trees ({{ generated.trees.length }} climate bands, {{ generated.fruitTrees.length }} fruit varieties)</h2>
<p class="muted">
  Regular tree/shrub species generate by climate band (temperature, rain, forest density, soil
  fertility, terrain height); fruit tree varieties are a flat temperature/rain band with no forest
  or fertility requirement.
</p>

<h3>Species</h3>
{% call dt.datatable(40, "Search tree species...", ["Species", "Kind", "Temp (°C)", "Rain", "Fertility", "Forest", "Mod"]) %}
{% for t in generated.trees | sort(false, false, "generator") %}
  <tr data-search="{{ t.generator }} {{ t.logBlockCode }} {{ t.leavesBlockCode }}" data-category="{{ 'shrub' if t.isShrub else 'tree' }}" data-mod="{{ t.sourceMod }}">
    <td>{{ t.generator }}{% if t.habitat %} <span class="tag">{{ t.habitat }}</span>{% endif %}</td>
    <td><span class="tag">{{ "shrub" if t.isShrub else "tree" }}</span></td>
    <td>{% if t.minTemp != null or t.maxTemp != null %}{{ t.minTemp if t.minTemp != null else "any" }}&ndash;{{ t.maxTemp if t.maxTemp != null else "any" }}{% endif %}</td>
    <td>{% if t.minRain != null or t.maxRain != null %}{{ (t.minRain if t.minRain != null else 0) | round(2) }}&ndash;{{ (t.maxRain if t.maxRain != null else 1) | round(2) }}{% endif %}</td>
    <td>{% if t.minFertility != null or t.maxFertility != null %}{{ (t.minFertility if t.minFertility != null else 0) | round(2) }}&ndash;{{ (t.maxFertility if t.maxFertility != null else 1) | round(2) }}{% endif %}</td>
    <td>{% if t.minForest != null or t.maxForest != null %}{{ (t.minForest if t.minForest != null else 0) | round(2) }}&ndash;{{ (t.maxForest if t.maxForest != null else 1) | round(2) }}{% endif %}</td>
    <td><span class="tag">{{ t.sourceMod }}</span></td>
  </tr>
{% endfor %}
{% endcall %}

<h3>Fruit varieties</h3>
{% call dt.datatable(40, "Search fruit varieties...", ["Fruit", "Temp (°C)", "Rain", "Mod"]) %}
{% for ft in generated.fruitTrees | sort(false, false, "variety") %}
  <tr data-search="{{ ft.variety }} {{ ft.fruitItemCode }}" data-mod="{{ ft.sourceMod }}">
    <td>{% if ft.fruitItemCode %}<a href="{{ ('/' ~ lang ~ '/') | url }}items/{{ ft.domain }}/{{ ft.fruitItemCode | slugify }}/">{{ ft.variety }}</a>{% else %}{{ ft.variety }}{% endif %}</td>
    <td>{{ ft.minTemp }}&ndash;{{ ft.maxTemp }}</td>
    <td>{{ ft.minRain }}&ndash;{{ ft.maxRain }}</td>
    <td><span class="tag">{{ ft.sourceMod }}</span></td>
  </tr>
{% endfor %}
{% endcall %}
